{'symbol': 'TGT', 'date': '2022-03-10 06:30:00', 'title': 'TARGET CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, MARCH 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TARGET CORPORATION (NYSE: TGT) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 90 CENTS PER COMMON SHARE.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 10, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS MAY 18, 2022.'}